# ronoctua-distro — .gitignore
#
# The rule that governs this file: it must NEVER swallow versioned source by
# accident — the hand-kept lexicon and overlay, the tray table, the tokens, the
# code. The negations at the end exist for that, and they come last on purpose:
# in git, the LAST matching rule wins.
#
# Enforced by the `gitignore-keeps-fonts` check of `nix flake check`.
#
# The FONT FILES (4.1 GB) do not live here: they are assets of a Release of this
# repository, fetched as four flake inputs. See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.

# --- scratch ----------------------------------------------------------------
/.TEMP/

# --- Nix --------------------------------------------------------------------
result
result-*
/.direnv/
.envrc.local

# --- Python (the two font generators) ---------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Rust -------------------------------------------------------------------
/target/
**/target/
*.rs.bk

# --- precompiled WASM (produced by the build, never versioned) --------------
*.cwasm
/buffers/**/pkg/

# --- generated by the build from the real font file -------------------------
# None of this is source: it all comes out of the glyph generator. See
# docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
/crates/ronoctua-tokens/src/generated/
/crates/ronoctua-glyphdb/data/
/crates/ronoctua-i18n/src/generated/
*.fst
glyphs.bin
/crates/ronoctua-protocol/wit/deps/
icons.rs
coverage.md
manifest.json

# --- machine-specific, generated at install time ----------------------------
#
# `**/host.nix` WAS THE PATTERN HERE, and it swallowed `nix/modules/host.nix`
# along with it — the MODULE that declares the options, which is versioned code.
# While there was no git that cost nothing; on the first `nix flake check` with
# the repository initialised, Nix filters the source through git and the module
# simply vanished from the flake: "Path 'nix/modules/host.nix' is not tracked by
# Git".
#
# What is GENERATED is the host.nix at the ROOT and the one in nix/hosts/. The
# module stays.
/host.nix
/nix/hosts/host.nix
*.facter.json
/facter.json

# --- secrets: none of this enters the repository ----------------------------
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.age
*.gpg
*.kbx
/secrets/
.secrets/
secrets.yaml
!secrets.example.yaml
/keys/
**/lanzaboote/keys/
**/secureboot/keys/
.sops.local.yaml
*_ed25519
*_rsa
*_ecdsa
id_*
!id_*.pub
.age-key
age.key

# --- heavy test artefacts ---------------------------------------------------
*.qcow2
*.img
*.iso
*.vdi
/vm-state/
*.log
!/tests/**/*.log.expected

# --- editor and OS ----------------------------------------------------------
/.vscode/
/.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
.claude/

# ============================================================================
# DO NOT IGNORE — versioned source.
# These rules come last on purpose: in git the LAST matching rule wins, so any
# broad glob above is reverted here.
# ============================================================================
!/assets/
!/assets/**
!/assets/lexicon/**
!/assets/icons/**
!/assets/tokens/**
!/docs/**
!/nix/installer/**
!/tests/**/*.nix
